{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-fields-gco-mbr-district-11-meydan-south","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":353,"crm_id":"1212","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"The Fields","slug":"the-fields-gco-mbr-district-11-meydan-south","display_address":"MBR District 11 (Meydan South)","building_type":["townhouse"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"G&CO","price":4500000,"display_price":"4.5M","lattitude":25.0961812,"longitude":55.1560705,"min_bedrooms":0,"max_bedrooms":0,"display_bedrooms":"TBA","about":"<p>The Fields is a complex of stylish townhouses in the quiet neighborhood of District 11, Meydan. The townhouses feature excellent floor plans. All bedrooms on the upper level have access to terraces. The family entertainment area is located on both the ground and first floors. The living room and first floor bedroom both have access to the backyard. All bedrooms have en-suite bathrooms and walk-in closets. The kitchens are fully equipped with appliances and there is a separate staff room. The project is located near a nature reserve, golf course, racecourse, world-class sports complex and Meydan One Mall, which will have the world's longest indoor ski slope. Here residents will be able to enjoy strolls through lush parks, picnic on soft lawns, compete with friends on sports fields, and shop for groceries, clothing and medicine without leaving the location.</p><p>Residents have access to the infrastructure of The Fields community: eight parks with tennis courts, five large swimming pools, barbecue areas and various sports fields. A 10-minute drive takes you to Ras el Khor Wildlife Sanctuary, a natural lagoon surrounded by mangrove forest. The residential complex is surrounded by the main roads of the city: Al Ain Rd (E66) 1.8 km away, Ras Al Khor Road (E44) 9 km away and Sheikh Mohammed bin Zayed Road (E311) 11 km away.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1212/images/2024/02/29/7f77E7VJgQGoSAhQXCZE6BNDqogfkONMR0Rm9FN8.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/29/7f77E7VJgQGoSAhQXCZE6BNDqogfkONMR0Rm9FN8.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1212/images/2024/02/29/GumvE1COSCR9yA7096l9w6eTSHGPXbfVHDezQvQm.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/29/GumvE1COSCR9yA7096l9w6eTSHGPXbfVHDezQvQm.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1212/images/2024/02/29/pDLZk9qVldcZEF1Zy795KIf9tBDDI0QuKWC2m2Im.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/29/pDLZk9qVldcZEF1Zy795KIf9tBDDI0QuKWC2m2Im.png","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1212/images/2024/02/29/hvM7sMFpMFYdoYp0KS0Ks9rzPbXmc1iGcBW2i1co.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/02/29/hvM7sMFpMFYdoYp0KS0Ks9rzPbXmc1iGcBW2i1co.png","__ggfxIndex":3}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2273,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1511,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"TBA ","payment_plans":[],"community":"Mohammed Bin Rashid City (MBR)","publish":1,"currency":"AED","amenities":[{"id":12997,"url":null,"text":"Covered Parking","type":null,"image":null},{"id":12998,"url":null,"text":"Security and CCTV","type":null,"image":null},{"id":12999,"url":null,"text":"Shared Pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":13000,"url":null,"text":"Shared SPA","type":null,"image":null},{"id":13001,"url":null,"text":"Kids Play Area","type":null,"image":null},{"id":13002,"url":null,"text":"Shared gym & fitness","type":null,"image":null},{"id":13003,"url":null,"text":"Dining outlets  (coffee houses & restaurants)","type":null,"image":null},{"id":13004,"ur